  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRADE FACILITATION START UP PROGRAMME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the programme is to facilitate prosperity through inclusive trade for Mozambique while the specific objectives are:  1. Empowering women in cross border trade (CBT); Reducing trade costs through the elimination of Non-Tariff Barriers (NTBs) along the Beira Corridor;  Strengthening the regulatory and implementation framework for Sanitary and Phyto Sanitary (SPS) measures and facilitating private sector compliance to standards and SPS for Horticulture exports</narrative>
  </description>
